WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 39 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
That old man never looked at me like that.

2
00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:03.840
Not once!

3
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:04.840
So...

4
00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:06.760
Let me get this straight.

5
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.640
I grew up an orphan nobody wanted and now you're telling me I have a father.

6
00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.160
Tell me you're happy to see me.

7
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:14.640
Please.

8
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.600
It was your naming day.

9
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.560
The whole city had turned out to celebrate you.

10
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.600
I went to bring you and your mother down to meet the guests.

11
00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:29.450
I lost your mother that day.

12
00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:31.850
And you, you were gone.

13
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:34.650
I've lived in hell for 20 years.

14
00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.050
I swear to you, Aris.

15
00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:37.650
I never stopped looking for you.

16
00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:42.930
I just need more time, this is a lot.

17
00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:50.300
Feral dragons tore the infant apart!

18
00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.900
So how the hell is he standing right there?

19
00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:57.700
By the dragon god, the Grand Duke ordered the Mothi to murder a newborn?

20
00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.100
Gentleman on the surface.

21
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:00.700
Butchers to the bone.

22
00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.500
Horduke Vellmont.

23
00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.700
He lost his wife and his only son on the same day.

24
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:07.700
Mordric!

25
00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.500
Jackson!

26
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.500
It was you! You killed my wife!

27
00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:12.500
You stole my son!

28
00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:16.210
Why did you ruin my family?

29
00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.210
What did you do to me?

30
00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:19.810
Twenty years ago!
